This repository contains the GoldCube brand shell and Node HTTP gateway.
It serves local pages, bridges APIs, forwards application resources, and
adapts application pages with brand DOM/CSS and URL rewriting. It operates
with the separately maintained GoldCube application, based on:
  https://github.com/csyqlz/VOZEB-PRO
  commit 04b32d31ca00272e3866c85e9a8329036c63af72 (old AGPL baseline)
The application repository is:
  https://github.com/fandy20082008/GoldCube
The gateway repository is:
  https://github.com/fandy20082008/GoldCube-Gateway

